{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not a shepherd\u2014you\u2019re an athlete!  Team up with a friend or ride solo and speed through dynamic, fast-paced levels, herding sheep in a futuristic medieval competition.\u00a0<strong>Explode</strong>, <strong>Teleport</strong>, <strong>Warp</strong> to enhance your parkour skills and outmaneuver the flock. Compete  for the top spot on the global leaderboard\u2014because in this world, catching sheep is the ultimate test of speed and skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Features:</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>COOP RACE</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends have been handpicked to compete in the prestigious Sheep Seeker World Tournament, where only the best can seek out the hidden sheep across dynamic levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/GIF_Coop_Steampage_-_Sheep_Seeker.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>SOLO GAMEMODE</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also play solo and compete against players from around the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/GIF_Solo_Steampage_-_Sheep_Seeker.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>UNIQUE LOADOUTS</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run, craft your strategy and select your unique loadout to maximize your performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/weapons.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>A LEADERBOARD</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your times with smart strategies and shortcuts to race to the top of the global leaderboards. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/leaderboard.png?t=1740316123\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3113650?t=1740316123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740316123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/77140f238f568dce527f3c238228fe6312fb8b55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740316123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/77140f238f568dce527f3c238228fe6312fb8b55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740316123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3177370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not a shepherd\u2014you\u2019re an athlete!  Team up with a friend or ride solo and speed through dynamic, fast-paced levels, herding sheep in a futuristic medieval competition.\u00a0<strong>Explode</strong>, <strong>Teleport</strong>, <strong>Warp</strong> to enhance your parkour skills and outmaneuver the flock. Compete  for the top spot on the global leaderboard\u2014because in this world, catching sheep is the ultimate test of speed and skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Features:</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>COOP RACE</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends have been handpicked to compete in the prestigious Sheep Seeker World Tournament, where only the best can seek out the hidden sheep across dynamic levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/GIF_Coop_Steampage_-_Sheep_Seeker.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>SOLO GAMEMODE</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also play solo and compete against players from around the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/GIF_Solo_Steampage_-_Sheep_Seeker.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>UNIQUE LOADOUTS</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run, craft your strategy and select your unique loadout to maximize your performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/weapons.gif?t=1740316123\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>A LEADERBOARD</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your times with smart strategies and shortcuts to race to the top of the global leaderboards. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/extras/leaderboard.png?t=1740316123\" /></p>","developers":["Isaac MENARD","Matt\u00e9o GLAIRON-MONDET","Alexander KIRK","S\u00e9verin RICHARD","Lucas RENARD","Quentin EUNG","Fran\u00e7ois HANUS","Matthew GARCIN","Matthieu FARROW"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113650/header.jpg?t=1740316123","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[]